- Don't forget to check `apps/web/src/lib/api/` for any other files that might exist besides auth.ts, vault.ts, ipfs.ts, client.ts, and the __tests__ directory.
- Check `apps/web/src/lib/web3auth/hooks.ts` — it imports `authApi` from `../api/auth` (note: this is `lib/api/auth`, not `src/api/auth`). This import path stays the same since we're keeping `lib/api/auth.ts` as a thin adapter.
- The `apps/web/src/api/auth/` directory (generated) has an `index.ts` or barrel export that `lib/web3auth/hooks.ts` might import. Double-check.

